      "content": "i just feel like i'm running a race where the finish line keeps moving further away. every single cent i make just goes straight back out to rent and interest and bills. i'm literally working myself to death just to afford to stay alive for another month. it doesn't even feel like living anymore, it just feels like paying a subscription fee to exist that i can't afford.",
